---
// Hero.astro — The Two Pillars (Czystość, Skala, Autorytet)
---

<section
  data-hero
  class="relative w-full min-h-[100svh] bg-[#F8FAFC] text-[#0B1523] flex flex-col justify-between pt-24 sm:pt-32 pb-8 px-5 sm:px-8 md:px-12 border-b border-slate-200"
>
  <!-- GŁÓWNY KOMUNIKAT BIZNESOWY (Zrozumiały w 2 sekundy) -->
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center mt-2 sm:mt-6 mb-12 sm:mb-16">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm text-slate-600 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-wider uppercase mb-6 font-semibold">
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#0066CC]"></span>
      <span>Centralna Dystrybucja i Inżynieria Hydrauliczna</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="font-extrabold text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl uppercase tracking-tighter text-[#0B1523] leading-[1.05] mb-6">
      Kontrola Przepływu.<br class="hidden sm:block" /> Od zasilania ziemi po 200 barów.
    </h1>

    <p class="font-sans text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-medium">
      Dobieramy i dostarczamy certyfikowaną armaturę przesyłową dla rolnictwa oraz wysokociśnieniowe jednostki pompowe Udor dla myjni bezdotykowych. Wybierz swój obszar:
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- INTERAKTYWNY MONOLIT WYBORU (The Two Pillars) -->
  <div class="relative z-20 flex-1 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full">
    
    <!-- FILAR 01: AGRO / RURAPE.PL -->
    <a
      href="https://rurape.pl"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="group relative flex flex-col justify-end min-h-[400px] lg:min-h-[480px] p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden"
    >
      <!-- Fotografia najwyższej jakości: Nawadnianie rolnicze -->
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:scale-105 filter brightness-[0.65]"
        style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586771107445-d3ca888129ff?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80');"
      ></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#021811] via-[#021811]/60 to-transparent"></div>

      <div class="relative z-10">
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-500/20 backdrop-blur-md border border-emerald-400/30 text-emerald-300 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-4 rounded-md">
          01 // Nawadnianie Agro
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tighter uppercase mb-3">
          Magistrale Nawadniania
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-200 leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-md">
          Atestowane rury polietylenowe PE100 i PE100-RC dla sadownictwa, plantacji i rolnictwa. Pewny przesył wody.
        </p>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-xs text-white/90 mb-6 hidden sm:flex">
          <span class="px-2 py-1 border border-white/20 bg-black/20 rounded backdrop-blur-sm">Średnice: 16–110 mm</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-1 border border-white/20 bg-black/20 rounded backdrop-blur-sm">Certyfikat PE100-RC</span>
        </div>

        <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-between w-full py-4 px-6 rounded-xl bg-white text-[#0B1523] group-hover:bg-emerald-500 group-hover:text-white font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold transition-colors">
          <span>Przejdź do oferty rur: rurape.pl</span>
          <span class="text-lg leading-none transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">&rarr;</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- FILAR 02: MYJNIE / SERCEMYJNI.PL -->
    <a
      href="https://sercemyjni.pl"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="group relative flex flex-col justify-end min-h-[400px] lg:min-h-[480px] p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden"
    >
      <!-- Fotografia najwyższej jakości: Wysokie ciśnienie -->
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:scale-105 filter brightness-[0.55]"
        style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1601362840469-51e4d8d58785?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80');"
      ></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#1A050B] via-[#1A050B]/60 to-transparent"></div>

      <div class="relative z-10">
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-rose-500/20 backdrop-blur-md border border-rose-400/30 text-rose-300 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-4 rounded-md">
          02 // Pompy Myjni Udor
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tighter uppercase mb-3">
          Systemy Wysokociśnieniowe
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-200 leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-md">
          Włoskie pompy nurnikowe Udor, agregaty i armatura przystosowane do pracy ciągłej 24/7 w myjniach bezdotykowych.
        </p>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-xs text-white/90 mb-6 hidden sm:flex">
          <span class="px-2 py-1 border border-white/20 bg-black/20 rounded backdrop-blur-sm">Ciśnienie: do 200 Bar</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-1 border border-white/20 bg-black/20 rounded backdrop-blur-sm">Nurniki: Ceramika</span>
        </div>

        <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-between w-full py-4 px-6 rounded-xl bg-white text-[#0B1523] group-hover:bg-[#DC2626] group-hover:text-white font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold transition-colors">
          <span>Otwórz ofertę pomp: sercemyjni.pl</span>
          <span class="text-lg leading-none transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">&rarr;</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </a>

  </div>

  <!-- DOLNY PASEK BIZNESOWY -->
  <div class="relative z-10 pt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider gap-3">
    <span>Dostawy Cała Polska &middot; Bydgoszcz</span>
    <a href="#about" class="flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:text-[#0B1523] transition-colors font-bold">
      <span>Zarządzanie: Tomasz Kulpa</span>
      <span>&darr;</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>